# Phase 1: Transcript Analysis — John Rusic on AI-Driven Business Models

---

## 1. The Villain

Companies are abandoning their core business identity to chase AI headlines — implementing AI because a competitor launched a chatbot or a news cycle demanded it, without ever asking whether it serves the business they built. The result is wasted investment, sub-optimal outcomes, and the erosion of the human connections that made them successful in the first place.

